    "body": "## What\n\n- New `skills/sglang-explainer-video/references/publishing.md`, a recipe for publishing the finished video to Bilibili and 小红书:\n  - who picks files and what the agent fills in;\n  - each form field;\n  - the cover checks;\n  - how to verify the result.\n- Hard rule from the user: **every 小红书 note must 标记 SGLang**, the official account with the orange SGL avatar and userId `657172690000000020031d3f`. The path is 添加组件 → 标记地点或标记朋友 → 用户 → SGLang, which puts the note on the account's 标记墙.\n- The guide also says **not** to @SGLang in the body. An @ only sends notifications and is not a tag; this was learned the hard way in this PR's first commit.\n- Documents the 标记 dialog gotchas:\n  - the user list needs real mouse clicks;\n  - the outer 确定 is off-screen in a narrow pane;\n  - new and existing markers carry different `.marker-container` ids.\n- Documents how to edit an already-published note, including that the 发布 button lives inside `<xhs-publish-btn>`'s shadow DOM.\n- `SKILL.md` gets a step 10, \"Publish (only when the user asks)\", and a References entry.\n- `house-style.md` Delivery now mentions the publishing guide and the 标记 rule.\n- Plugin version 0.9.2 → 0.9.3.\n\n## Why\n\nThe publishing workflow was only kept in agent memory, and the user asked for every 小红书 post to tag SGLang from now on.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Exercised end to end on 2026-10-15:\n  - the Step 5 Preview video went out on Bilibili (BV1TeJk6UEs4) and on 小红书;\n  - all 11 published 小红书 notes were then edited to carry the SGLang 标记, and each showed 「已添加1个标记」 and 「更新成功」.\n- `pre-commit run` on the changed files passes, including codespell.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
